claim.claim-text:
the accessory comprises a printer;
the storage bag comprises a printer bag; and
the portion of the defibrillator comprises a back of the defibrillator.

the printer bag comprises clips disposed on an exterior surface of the printer bag;
the defibrillator comprises a kickstand coupled to the back of the defibrillator; and
the clips are configured to clip onto a portion of the kickstand within the clips.
